
## Measurements

| Measurement | Range (cm) |
|-------------|------------|
| Sepal Length | 4.3 - 7.9 |
| Sepal Width | 2.0 - 4.4 |
| Petal Length | 1.0 - 6.9 |
| Petal Width | 0.1 - 2.5 |

## Species

- **setosa** - Typically has smaller petals
- **versicolor** - Medium-sized measurements
- **virginica** - Typically has larger petals
